invariant: INV-14
file: tls.c
catches: unit
reason: tlsi_config_ok takes an empty PSK identity, which RFC 9846 section
  4.3.11 does not allow, so ch_connect sends a ClientHello every server
  must refuse. bin/unit requires CH_EINVAL and no send for an identity of
  0 bytes.

--- old
    return len >= 1 && len <= CH_TICKET_ID_MAX;
--- new
    return len <= CH_TICKET_ID_MAX;
